          <p>
            Buy a name brand at Sprouts instead of the house powder if you need more protein per scoop, organic certification or sport testing. The house powders win only on ingredient simplicity and occasional sale prices. Each of the three big plant brands on the Sprouts shop solves a different problem.
          </p>

