          <p>
            Sprouts' online shop lists Garden of Life Raw Organic Protein in unflavored and vanilla and Garden of Life Sport in vanilla and chocolate. Raw Organic gives 22 g of protein in about 130 calories per the label; Sport gives 30 g in about 160 calories and carries NSF Certified for Sport, per the brand. Both are USDA Organic. The Sprouts shop listed Sport chocolate at $49.99 for 29.6 oz when we checked, while the Amazon 19-serving tub was $41.99, about $1.84 per 25 g.
