            Orgain Organic Protein gives 21 g of protein per two-scoop serving, is USDA Organic and is sweetened with stevia, per the label. Sprouts lists it in vanilla bean, creamy chocolate fudge and natural unsweetened, plus the Protein and Superfoods version and a keto line. It is the closest name-brand match to the Sprouts vegan powder, with one more gram of protein and an organic seal, but the online Sprouts price was steep. See our <a href="/orgain-protein-powder-review/">Orgain protein powder review</a> for the full label.
