          <div class="faq-list">
            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary><h3>Is Sprouts protein powder third-party tested?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  No third-party testing is published for Sprouts protein powder. Neither the Sprouts whey nor the Sprouts vegan label or listing mentions NSF Certified for Sport, Informed Sport or a Clean Label Project result. Drug-tested athletes should choose a certified powder; Sprouts also stocks Garden of Life Sport, which Garden of Life lists as NSF Certified for Sport.
