                  No artificial sweeteners appear on the labels we checked. Sprouts vanilla whey is sweetened with monk fruit only, while the chocolate and strawberry whey and the vegan powders use stevia leaf extract plus monk fruit. If you avoid stevia, the vanilla whey is the one to pick, and our guide to <a href="/best-protein-powder-without-stevia/">protein powder without stevia</a> lists more.
                </p>
